@title Digital Support Summary, January to September
@subtitle Customer Support, Gullwing Airlines (digital channels)
@author Customer Support

Support volume, response times and satisfaction for digital channels from January to September 2026.

kpi Tickets | 18,420 | September | neutral
kpi Median first response | 2.4 hours | September | neutral
kpi CSAT | 4.3 out of 5 | September | good
kpi Self-service deflection | 37% | September | good

# Ticket volume

data tix = Month,Tickets; Jan,15210; Feb,14380; Mar,16950; Apr,17210; May,16480; Jun,21740; Jul,23960; Aug,20110; Sep,18420
chart line tix x=Month y=Tickets title="Tickets per month"

# Tickets by category

data cat = Category,Tickets; Refunds,5130; Booking changes,4470; Baggage,3260; Loyalty points,2410; App login,1840; Other,1310
chart hbar cat x=Category y=Tickets labels title="September tickets by category"

# CSAT by channel

table = Channel,Tickets,Median first response (h),CSAT; Chat,8920,0.3,4.5; Email,6140,6.8,3.9; Phone callback,2210,1.1,4.4; Social,1150,3.2,4.0

# Notes

- The June and July spike came from the summer schedule changes.
- The new refund self-service form launched on 2026-08-12.
- Email response times remain the weakest point.

!! Refunds are still the largest category despite the new form.
